    <!-- Terms and Conditions -->
    <string name="terms_title">Terms &amp; Conditions</string>
    <string name="terms_body">This app uses your device\'s location to record and display your gliding flights. Flights, gliders and airfields you add are stored locally on your device.\n\nThis app depends on your device\'s GPS signal to track your flight. A low, weak, or obstructed GPS signal may cause inaccurate readings or the loss of flight data. Always verify your position and altitude by other means when GPS signal is uncertain.\n\nThe glide safety circles shown on the map are calculated using your selected glider\'s glide ratio, assuming a return to your take-off location or selected airfield with a minimum safety altitude of 1500 ft. If no glider is selected, a default glide ratio of 18:1 is used. These circles are an estimate only and do not account for wind, terrain, or other flight conditions.\n\nTo help improve app stability and accuracy, this app may collect anonymous analytics and crash reports. This does not include your location or any other personal or sensitive data.\n\nUsing this flight logger is at your own risk. The developer is not responsible for any damage to equipment or injury to persons resulting from use of this app. This app is not a substitute for looking around you during flight.\n\nMy Gliding Assistant is provided \"as is\", without warranty of any kind, and is not a substitute for official flight instruments or aviation charts. You are responsible for your own flight safety decisions.\n\nThe developer is continually working on improvements and new features for future releases.\n\nBy continuing, you acknowledge that you have read and agree to these terms.</string>
    <string name="terms_checkbox_label">I\'ve read and agree to the Terms and Conditions</string>
